<td id="S3.T5.3.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">Abdin et al. (2023)</a></cite></td></tr>
