<span id="A4.T16.6.1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Generates diverse continuations using top-<math id="A4.T16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> sampling to reveal implicit directional bias across completions.</span>
</span></td></tr>
